Based on ProxyPin Certificate Installer by firdausmntp / wanghongenpin.
https://github.com/wanghongenpin/Magisk-ProxyPinCA
Reference commit: d4ff2b93e515a074ee2deab48c56fd6473213fb6
The upstream LICENSE is GNU GPL version 2; it is included without changes.

B-box adaptations:
- Generate the ZIP in the app using only that installation's public CA.
- Use the separate bbox_http_debug_ca module ID; do not bundle a default CA.
- Omit the default certificate, WebUI, action scripts and update feed.
- Share boot helpers between post-fs-data and service; mount both system and
  Conscrypt stores without relying on the root manager's automatic overlay.
- Use module-private staging paths, preserve hash collisions and require a
  complete copy of the original trust store before binding the replacement.
- Retry namespace mounts for B-box and Settings after boot.
- Prepare a complete CA store inside each destination mount namespace.

Source: https://github.com/giturass/B-box/tree/newui/app/src/main/assets/capture-module
